  intermissionLines:
  - speaker: Player
    text: That operation was tough, but I was able to get through it with your help
      Rina.
  - speaker: Nurse Rina
    text: 'You''ve done well for your first day on the job so far. '
  - speaker: Nurse Rina
    text: 'Enjoy a well deserved rest from doing surgeries. '
  - speaker: Annie
    text: 'The food is great here and thanks for treating me earlier. '
  - speaker: Player
    text: 'Glad you like the food, and you''re welcome to come for treatments whenever
      you need. '
  - speaker: Player
    text: 'Just keep supporting the tavern with your patronage. '
  - speaker: Narrator
    text: You keep working during the dinner rush serving the patrons, but right
      before the day ends a heavily wounded adventurer walks in.
